    justification: "non-blocking UX issue; does not affect correctness of bakeoff results. The 30-repo bakeoff completed successfully with the current numbering. Will address in a future PR when doing bakeoff infrastructure improvements."  # 6616
    description: "Currently `init` creates sub-sessions under the latest top-level directory, and cohort numbers auto-increment globally across all sessions. This makes it confusing to map curriculum cohorts (1-6) to actual directory names (cohort-009 through cohort-014). Consider: per-session cohort numbering, or at minimum labeling cohorts with the curriculum name. Deferred: non-blocking UX issue; does not affect correctness of bakeoff results. The 30-repo bakeoff completed successfully with the current numbering. Will address in a future PR when doing bakeoff infrastructure improvements."  # 6616
    fields: {}  # 6616
